---
layout: base.njk
title: Проекти
description: Примерни изпълнени проекти — фотоволтаични системи за дома и бизнеса, навеси и наземни решения.
---

<main>
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-blue/80 mb-2">Проекти</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-blue">Реални изпълнения</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-brand-blue/80 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Подбираме решение според обекта и целите. Тук показваме примерни проекти (структурата е готова за вашите реални данни).
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {% for p in projects %}
        <a href="{{ ('/proekti/' ~ p.slug ~ '/') | url }}" class="group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-blue/10 bg-brand-buttercream shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <img src="{{ ('/assets/images/' ~ p.images[0]) | url }}" alt="{{ p.title }}" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover">
          <div class="p-6">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-brand-blue group-hover:underline">{{ p.title }}</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-blue/80 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">{{ p.shortDescription }}</p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-brand-blue/80">
              {% if p.capacityKwp %}<span class="rounded-full border border-brand-blue/15 px-3 py-1 bg-white/70">{{ p.capacityKwp }} kWp</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-accent text-brand-blue font-semibold px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:opacity-95">
              Виж проекта
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

